# Model-replay output. Real client sessions land here, so the files carry a
# `sessionId` and a `costUsd` from the run. They are kept out of the repository by
# default; promoting one into docs/evidence/ is a deliberate act (`git add -f`),
# not something a `git add .` should do on its way to a publish.
